  'phonetics.case_more_examples': "**Want more examples?** Switch to the **Linking Rules** tab at the top · compound final consonant linking, with 읽어요/없어요/밟아요 and more “double final + vowel → linking” cases.",
  'phonetics.sheet_sound_label': "Pronunciation tip",
