  'membership.faq_upgrade_q': "If I upgrade from monthly to yearly, do I lose my remaining days?",
  'membership.faq_upgrade_a': "No. Your <b>remaining days carry over</b> — e.g., 20 days left on monthly → upgrade to yearly gives <em>20 + 365 = 385 days</em>. New yearly benefits (higher AI quota, unlimited voice, learning reports) <b>apply immediately</b>.",
  'membership.faq_lifetime_q': "What does lifetime include? Can I upgrade from yearly?",
  'membership.faq_lifetime_a': "Yes. Any plan can upgrade to lifetime. You get <b>all perks forever</b>: unlimited AI, free updates, early access to new features, and a <b>custom gift box</b> (free shipping in mainland China). Remaining days are factored into the gift box value.",
  'membership.faq_lifetime_a_overseas': "Yes. Any paid plan can be upgraded to lifetime. After upgrade, <b>all benefits are permanent & unlimited</b>: unlimited AI usage, free lifetime updates, early access to new features, and <b>product co-building privileges</b>.",
  'membership.faq_renew_q': "If I renew yearly before it expires, when does the new period start?",
  'membership.faq_renew_a': "It <b>extends from your current expiry date</b>. Renewing early doesn't overwrite remaining days — e.g., 30 days left → new expiry is <em>30 + 365 = 395 days later</em>.",
  'membership.faq_trial_q': "Can I upgrade during the 3-day free trial? Will my trial days be wasted?",
  'membership.faq_trial_a': "No, they won't be wasted. If you upgrade during the trial, <b>remaining trial days are added</b> to your new membership—for example, if you upgrade to annual with 2 trial days left, you get <em>2 + 365 = 367 days</em>.",
  'membership.faq_data_q': "Will my learning data still be there after my membership expires?",
  'membership.faq_data_a': "<b>Everything is kept, nothing is lost.</b> All your learning data—word lists, diary, grammar progress, TOPIK error book—is saved forever. Expiration only limits AI credits and features; resubscribe and it's all back.",
  'membership.faq_refund_q': "Can I get a refund?",
  'membership.faq_refund_a': "Yes. Please <a href=\"/messages\">contact support</a> with your order number and reason. We'll process the refund within 1-3 business days, and the money will be returned to your original payment method. Membership benefits end immediately after refund.",
  'membership.faq_autorenew_q': "Does it auto-renew? Can I cancel?",
  'membership.faq_autorenew_a': "<b>Monthly and yearly plans auto-renew by default</b>, so your membership extends automatically before expiration. You can cancel auto-renewal anytime in <a href=\"/mine/membership\">Membership Center</a>. After cancellation, it stops at the end of the current period. Lifetime purchase has no auto-renewal.",
